WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:05.250
A former model and Miss Israel winner, actress
Gal Gadot has always been lean and mean.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:09.010
In order to play the title character in Warner
Bros.'s Wonder Woman, Gadot had to make her

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.760
body a little less lean, and a whole lot meaner.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.640
Making the leap from model to superhero is
no easy feat, but here's how Gal Gadot got

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.950
in shape to play Wonder Woman.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.270
Real life warrior

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:23.640
It's well known that Gadot represented her
home country of Israel in the 2004 Miss Universe

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.640
pageant.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.430
Less well known, however, is the fact that
as an Israeli citizen, Gadot also served a

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.360
compulsory two-year term of service in the
nation's military.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.910
But she didn't merely scrape through and serve
her time — Gadot dominated the intensive

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:38.750
three-month military boot camp and earned
herself a spot as a combat trainer.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.440
Even still, Gadot said that her training for
Wonder Woman was actually even more difficult

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.590
than training for the army.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.870
"Do you think being in the Israeli army helped
you with your training?"

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:52.400
"Um, it was a lot more intensive."

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.590
She loves sports

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:59.350
Physical fitness is a lifelong passion for
Gadot, who learned to swim when she was four.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:03.530
Growing up, she spent 12 years training as
a dancer, while also playing tennis, basketball,

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.530
and volleyball.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:08.720
She told ESPNW that she's highly competitive
and that she always plays to win — "otherwise,

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:09.720
why bother, right?"

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:13.361
In her spare time, she also indulges in rock
climbing, all while taking care of her two

00:01:13.361 --> 00:01:14.580
young daughters.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.170
Now there's a real Wonder Woman.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.640
Diet of the gods

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:22.220
It may be hard to believe, but Gadot actually
didn't go on an insane diet to achieve her

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.820
superhuman fitness level.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:27.670
Instead, she simply practiced moderation and
common sense, using the tried and true method

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:31.140
of mixing greens with lean proteins to get
the most out of her workouts.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.100
She also kept hydrating, drinking a gallon
of water each day.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.119
But she told Harper's Bazaar that she more
or less ate what she wanted, when she wanted,

00:01:38.119 --> 00:01:40.720
and was able to get away with it because she
respected her body's needs.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:43.990
"I look at food as fuel and I want to give
the best to my body.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:47.460
It's all a matter of measurements and quantity
of the food; just enjoy your food and don't

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.910
eat while you drive and don't eat when you
talk on the phone.

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:53.310
Just give the food the respect and give yourself
the respect to enjoy it."

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.840
A beast in the gym

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.950
In order to prepare for the role of Wonder
Woman, Gadot spent months working with professional

00:01:58.950 --> 00:01:59.950
trainers.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.880
When she started, she couldn't execute a single
pull-up.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.380
But by the end she was ripping through a daily
routine that included rowing machines, stationary

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:10.679
bikes, broad jumps, crab walks, pull-ups,
push-ups, squats, ball exercises, and weightlifting.

00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:13.849
She may use a sword and a lasso in the film,
but there's no question that she can bust

00:02:13.849 --> 00:02:16.290
out the gun show whenever she wants.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.819
No cheat days

00:02:17.819 --> 00:02:20.040
When you're a superhero, you don't get any
days off.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.560
After all, the world isn't going to save itself.

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:27.209
That's why Gadot trained "six or seven hours
a day" every single day for half a year.

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:29.010
And that training wasn't confined to the gym
alone.

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:33.140
She also had to undergo ultra-intense weapons
training to learn how to properly use a sword

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:34.140
and shield.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.809
But the most difficult part of her training?

00:02:35.809 --> 00:02:37.510
Surprisingly, it was horseback riding.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.840
She explained it all in an Australian news
interview, "I also thought I was going to

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.480
love horse riding because it always looked
as if it’d be so easy.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.480
It’s not.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.909
It was super painful and I had tons of bruises.”

00:02:46.909 --> 00:02:48.590
She defeated Conan

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.340
Ever wonder what might happen if Wonder Woman
battled Conan?

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:55.299
Well, we learned the answer during Gadot's
promotional tour for Wonder Woman.

00:02:55.299 --> 00:02:59.829
Except it wasn't Conan the Barbarian she faced
off against — it was Conan O'Brien.

00:02:59.829 --> 00:03:03.930
Claiming he would accomplish in 35 minutes
what took Gadot months and months of everyday

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.790
training, Conan O'Brien bragged about his
three months of Girl Scouts service before

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.099
Gadot and her trainer critiqued his less than
heroic physique.

00:03:11.099 --> 00:03:16.180
Afterwards, Gadot showed off her powerful
high kicks before battling the comedian in

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:18.140
a swordfight.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.989
*grunting*

00:03:19.989 --> 00:03:24.859
If there's one thing to take away from this
segment, it's that Gal Gadot can not only

00:03:24.859 --> 00:03:28.689
dominate with her high kicks and physical
prowess, but also slay with her stunning good

00:03:28.689 --> 00:03:30.549
looks, personality and charm.

00:03:30.549 --> 00:03:32.269
She's a wonder, that Wonder Woman.

00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:33.269
Thanks for watching!

